<title>USA: Paxson to buy stations from American.</title>
<headline>Paxson to buy stations from American.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paxson Communications Corp said Wednesday it has reached an agreement to buy four West Palm Beach radio stations from American Radio Systems Corp.</p>
<p>A purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
<p>The stations are WKGR 98.7-FM, WOLL 94.3-FM, WBZT 1290-AM and WEAT 850-AM.  These proposed acquisitions increase the number of radio stations owned by Paxson to 47, including 43 in nine Florida markets.</p>
